      "status": "alternative",
      "period": "classical",
      "gloss": "arrogant, presumptuous",
      "grammar": "adjective, third declension, one ending: the participle of arrogō, “claim for oneself”",
      "evidence": [
        "Traupman 149: <span lang=\"la\">arrogāns</span>, arrogant; <span lang=\"la\">arrogantia</span>, arrogance"
      ],
      "comment": "One who claims more for himself than is his due."
    },
    {
