      ],
      "comment": "Its first sense is “unaccustomed, unusual” (<span lang=\"la\">verbum īnsolēns</span>, an unusual word, Gell. 1.10.4); from there, behaving beyond what is customary: arrogant, overbearing, especially in success (Lewis &amp; Short)."
